title: "Cranial 3D Computed Tomography for Computer-Aided Identification of Deceased Individuals"
type: software

abstract: >
  Four custom-made Python scripts for the computer-aided identification
  of deceased individuals based on cranial antemortem and postmortem
  computed tomography scans.

version: "1.0.0"

message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite this software
  repository.

